      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 28 · AI Survey Automation\nHosts a survey form, analyses each response with AI (NPS, sentiment, themes) and follows up with detractors.\n\n**Trigger:** hosted n8n form (open the Form Trigger to get the URL)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Gmail OAuth2, Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate."
      }
    }
